            "title_h3": false,
            "text": "<p>\"Fantastic! The last time I went snorkeling (more than 10 years ago) I wore contacts. At age 65, glasses only. I thought I was done snorkeling, until I found these! They worked perfectly! | could see the fish. And at around 80 bucks for the mask and a breather tube, it's a bargain.</p><p>They charge like $25 to rent them at the beaches when you go on a cruise (and it is gross using something that was in someone else's mouth!) I highly recommend these if you are near-sighted and want to snorkel.\"</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
