            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Sage, Utah",
            "title_h3": false,
            "text": "<p>\"I got the obsidian, my sister got the lumix, we also decided on matching snorkels, and they looked so cute together. We went snorkeling in mexico, and this time was so much less scary since not everything was blurry.</p><p>There were also some really cool tips in the snorkeling guide, we found the part about buddy safety and communication especially useful.\"</p>",
