        },
        "text_QnQtH9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When you buy from Oceans Optics, you are not just getting an excellent mask, you are helping us build a real living Coral Reef.</p><p>A portion of every sale goes towards our artificial reef project in Koh Tao, Thailand. We worked with Global Reef and the Thai Department of Marine & Coastal Resources to sink a custom steel structure shaped like a prescription scuba mask. Onto this frame we attached living coral fragments that grow over time, attracting fish and turning the structure into a living reef and safe haven for marine life.</p><p>So each time you wear your mask, be proud that you are also contributing to saving ocean we all love.</p>",
